    "One active React entry and four active Python runtime modules; old branches, monolith and inactive scaffold excluded.",
    "Private recruiting, personal founder records, credentials, environment state, caches and installed dependencies excluded.",
    "Bundled production build and pure-Python websockets retained with notices.",
    "Inherited evidence/provenance replaced by current checks and this focused record."
  ],
