    "Reject huge integer coordinates before finite-number conversion; keep malformed packets from disconnecting tracker.",
    "Replace obsolete legacy module import test with current no-network/no-optional-dependency import regression.",
    "Replace stale PowerShell launcher with current single-process demo launcher.",
    "Add cross-platform developer check command and actual launcher smoke check."
